//! Multimodal context-compilation assurance (`AFA-conformance-P03-F26`).
//!
//! The harness checks caller-supplied decision facts and peer summaries, retaining every
//! omission and uncertainty.  It emits only a local, content-addressed receipt and never
//! retrieves evidence or exports raw study data.

